<!-- Slide 2: Executive Summary -->
<div class="slide white">
    <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
    <p>SeaScope is a cutting-edge fishery intelligence platform designed
 specifically for Alaska's marine ecosystem. We provide real-time data 
visualization, predictive analytics, and comprehensive tide information 
to empower marine professionals with data-driven decision-making 
capabilities.</p>
    <div class="feature-box">
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>Transform complex fishery data into accessible, actionable 
insights that support sustainable fishing practices and informed 
decision-making across Alaska's marine industry.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Slide 3: The Challenge -->
<div class="slide">
    <h2>The Challenge</h2>
    <p>Alaska's fishing industry faces critical challenges:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Data Fragmentation</strong> - Information scattered across multiple sources</li>
        <li><strong>Limited Real-Time Access</strong> - Delayed data impacts operational decisions</li>
        <li><strong>Complex Analysis</strong> - Difficulty identifying patterns and trends</li>
        <li><strong>Inefficient Planning</strong> - Lack of integrated tide and release data</li>
        <li><strong>Resource Optimization</strong> - Suboptimal route planning and timing</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<!-- Slide 4: The Solution -->
<div class="slide white">
    <h2>The SeaScope Solution</h2>
    <h3>1. Interactive Mapping Technology</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Real-time visualization of fish releases and catches</li>
        <li>Species-specific color coding</li>
        <li>Quantity-based sizing</li>
        <li>Geographic filtering by hatchery</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>2. Advanced Analytics &amp; Trends</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Historical data tracking</li>
        <li>Predictive analytics</li>
        <li>Species breakdown analysis</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<!-- Slide 5: More Features -->
<div class="slide">
    <h2>Comprehensive Features</h2>
    <h3>3. Integrated Tide Information</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>High and low tide predictions</li>
        <li>Sunrise and sunset times</li>
        <li>Location-specific coastal data</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>4. Intelligent Filtering System</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Filter by species (Chinook, Sockeye, Coho, Pink, Chum)</li>
        <li>Filter by hatchery (7+ major Alaska hatcheries)</li>
        <li>Date range selection</li>
        <li>Release type (Hatchery vs Wild)</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<!-- Slide 6: Target Users -->
<div class="slide white">
