    </ul>
</div>

<!-- Slide 8: Technology -->
<div class="slide white">
    <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
    <p class="tagline">Modern, Reliable, Scalable</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> React + TypeScript for robust performance</li>
        <li><strong>Mapping:</strong> Leaflet.js for interactive visualizations</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Recharts for data visualization</li>
        <li><strong>Data Source:</strong> Alaska Department of Fish &amp; Game (ADF&amp;G)</li>
        <li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Cloud-based for 99.9% uptime</li>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> Enterprise-grade data protection</li>
        <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Responsive design for all devices</li>
    </ul>
</div>

